# Impossible triage arm (log 2026-07-31): the counter-punch on the heavy
# horde. Riposte predates the tech arc -- its two failures were housed on
# rosters without heavies. Their groups carry a 1000-tick delay and 17s
# staging, so the moment after a wave breaks is the one window a push can
# cross at 3.7x; the whole reserve, heavyTanks included, releases into it.

